WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:04.411
This video shows how to start a new conversation on a phone.

00:00:06.065 --> 00:00:14.393
Tap the menu button, choose Messages, then tap the blue plus button at the top right. The New Message window opens.

00:00:31.276 --> 00:00:39.100
In the To box, tap Search staff and type a name. Tap the person you want to write to, here Sara Ahmed.

00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:52.626
Add a subject if you like, then type your message in the Message box.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:16.636
Tap Send Message. The window closes and the conversation opens with your message in it.

00:01:26.045 --> 00:01:31.469
Your message is sent. Replies will appear in the same conversation.
